---
// src/components/sections/Hero.astro
---

<div class="relative max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 md:px-12 md:py-40 flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-center min-h-[80vh]">
    <!-- Decorative images -->
    <img src="/images/rocket.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="absolute top-[15%] left-6 md:-left-50 w-25 md:w-90 z-10 pointer-events-none" />
    <img src="/images/earth.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="absolute bottom-6 right-6 md:-right-30 w-24 md:w-50 z-0 opacity-95 pointer-events-none" />

    <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-serif font-light tracking-wide mb-6 leading-tight">
        デザインと開発
    </h1>

    <p class="text-lg md:text-xl font-sans opacity-70 max-w-4xl leading-relaxed mb-12">
        使いやすく見やすいWebサイトを目指し、
        日々学びながら制作に取り組んでいます。
    </p>

    <a href="/#works" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 border border-brand-dark px-8 py-4 text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase hover:bg-brand-dark hover:text-brand-light transition-colors">
        View My Works
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
    </a>
</div>
